Title:  Image Class

Seq:    5.11.4

Level:  4 - chunk

Class:  non-version

Timestamp: 20260725201623

Body:

This field label can be used to identify the name of a CSS class that is to be assigned to the HTML [img](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/img) tag generated by the [[Image Name]] field. 

Notice that `Image Class` should be used as a field label in order to invoke this functionality, but should not be used as a field type. Instead, the [[Combo]] field type can be used. 

Here is an example of what this would look like within the [[the Collection Template File]].

```
Image Class: <combo>
```
